  "title": "Roasted Garlic Aïoli",
  "description": "This roasted garlic aioli is a creamy mayo-based sauce flavored with a whole bulb of rich and fragrant roasted garlic for a delicious dip.",
  "authors": [
    "NB Roy"
  ],
